    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Formalize the proposed simple-program account of entropy increase and derive predictions for relaxation, recurrence, and entropy production in specified systems. Compare these against existing statistical-mechanics simulations and experimental time series and against standard rival accounts.";
