    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Agreement with entropy increase may not distinguish this account from standard statistical mechanics.", "Straightforward explanation is not itself a measurable outcome.";
